      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Forge%2C_New_York",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lake‑effect snow blankets the village, with McCauley Mountain Ski Resort averaging 120 inches of snow and 105 skiing days each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
